From ea449ae08652be5bbc210d1fea7e798096144828 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Fuentes <victor@vlinkz.dev>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:37:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 075/162] ASoC: codecs: wcd939x: Don't fail Type-C mode changes
 before MBHC init

The mux is registered long before MBHC exists, and the error aborted the
whole mux chain.

Signed-off-by: Victor Fuentes <victor@vlinkz.dev>
---
 sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
index 2d463f062e6d..aea27dc48e2e 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -3139,7 +3139,7 @@ static int wcd939x_typec_mux_set(struct typec_mux_dev *mux,
 	unsigned int previous_mode = wcd939x->typec_mode;
 
 	if (!wcd939x->wcd_mbhc)
-		return -EINVAL;
+		return 0;
 
 	if (wcd939x->typec_mode != state->mode) {
 		wcd939x->typec_mode = state->mode;
-- 
2.56.0

